                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "To me it looks like this is a fix for a bug i may have introduced in \n\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-state-manager/+/88755/4\n\nwhere taking the `else if` would prevent handling other power policies even if\n`!phosphor::state::manager::utils::checkACLoss(hostId)` would be false\n\nI believe this issue is not present in \nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-state-manager/+/88755/3\n\nso maybe that could also be a candidate fix.\n\nAnyways sorry about introducing this bug :/"
                }
